WEBVTT

00:04:30.133 --> 00:04:31.180
What we need --

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:33.973
and the word's been used
many times in the past few days --

00:04:33.997 --> 00:04:35.751
is not evolution,

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:38.378
but a revolution in education.

00:04:38.767 --> 00:04:41.976
This has to be transformed
into something else.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:47.022
(Applause)

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:53.305
One of the real challenges
is to innovate fundamentally in education.

00:04:54.106 --> 00:04:56.217
Innovation is hard,

00:04:56.241 --> 00:04:59.437
because it means doing something
that people don't find very easy,

00:04:59.461 --> 00:05:00.823
for the most part.